tolome-base (0.2.0) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Thunderbird replaces Evolution: set the default mail handlers
    (mimeapps.list) and the dock favorites. evolution-data-server is kept for
    GNOME Calendar and Contacts. The pin of the "gnome" metapackage lives in
    the live-build configuration (lintian forbids shipping apt preferences).

